<title>HONG KONG: Swire unit buys Reebok China distributor.</title>
<headline>Swire unit buys Reebok China distributor.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd said on Thursday its 66.67 percent controlled Reebok Hong Kong Ltd would buy Reebok (China) Holdings Ltd for US$5.0 million from Reebok International Ltd and Northgate Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>Reebok International holds 33.33 percent of Reebok Hong Kong, which distributes Reebok brand athletic shoes and apparel in Hong Kong and China's Guangdong province.</p>
<p>Reebok (China), which is 63.13 percent held by Reebok International and 36.87 percent by Northgate, distributes Reebook brand products in China excluding Guangdong province.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
